{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"b8f1db63d29a8199ad72d129c1acc860da9269ba687b2bbcb52d8b6ad855f6ee","digest":{"component_or_area":"store initialization and gitattributes convergence","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/init.py","_RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES",".reconciler-*",".gitattributes","tests/interfaces/store/test_gitattributes_merge.py","tests/interfaces/store/test_ensure_drift_matrix.py","docs/release-notes.md"],"problem_keywords":["deprecation removal","dead code","gitattributes","migration","reconciler"],"propositions":["The `.reconciler-* merge=ours` gitattributes strip arm in init.py (lines 600-616) is permanently unreachable because the reconciler pass-lock moved to `refs/reconciler/*` and the store already ran the migration.","The `_RETIRED_GITATTRIBUTES_LINES` constant and strip arm must be removed from `src/rebar/_commands/init.py` along with the migration paragraph from the ensure-unit docstring.","The gitattributes ensure-unit drift matrix test must be retargeted from 'committed .gitattributes carries the retired line' to 'no committed .gitattributes at all' to remain convergent.","The `test_gitattributes_migration_strips_retired_reconciler_line` test (lines 104-116) covers only the deleted arm and must be removed."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787542264767303001,"uuid":"61b47f4d-e6f1-42dd-8ed9-136c5e516e9e"}